issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "Hi guys,\n\nI am using mavsdk v3. Could you please help me understand the difference between `Mavsdk mavsdk{Mavsdk::Configuration{ComponentType::GroundStation}};` and `Mavsdk::Configuration{ComponentType::CompanionComputer};`?\n\nIn the examples given, I found `CompanionComputer` is only used by `mavlink_direct` while `GroundStation` is used by the other examples. But I cannot tell their differences between using them.", "closed_by": {"login": "ZhongmouLi", "id": 21055404, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjIxMDU1NDA0", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21055404?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/ZhongmouLi", "html_url": "https://github.com/ZhongmouLi", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ZhongmouLi/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ZhongmouLi/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ZhongmouLi/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ZhongmouLi/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ZhongmouLi/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ZhongmouLi/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ZhongmouLi/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ZhongmouLi/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ZhongmouLi/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2701/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2701/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null}, "comments": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/3483068514", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2701#issuecomment-3483068514", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2701", "id": 3483068514, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s7Pm2hi", "user": {"login": "JonasVautherin", "id": 2606672, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDY2NzI=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2606672?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin", "html_url": "https://github.com/JonasVautherin", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2025-11-03T23:58:41Z", "updated_at": "2025-11-03T23:58:41Z", "body": "It will be recognised differently by the autopilot (e.g. your program will have a different MAVLink system_id and component_id).\n\nSay your drone is configured to refuse to takeoff if no ground station is connected and your MAVSDK program enumerates as a companion computer, then the drone will refuse to takeoff. If MAVSDK says it is a ground station, then the drone will takeoff.\n\nYou probably don't want to enumerate as a ground station if you actually run onboard the drone, because then the failsafe won't work properly. Same if you run your MAVSDK code on the ground, you probably want to enumerate as a ground station so that 